    "created_at": "2016-02-01T16:26:41Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-02-01T16:26:41Z",
    "body": "Proposal:\n\n``` WebIDL\nenum SeekMode { \"precise\", \"fast\" };\n\ndictionary SeekOptions {\n  SeekMode mode = \"precise\";\n};\n\npartial interface HTMLMediaElement {\n  Promise<void> seek(double time, optional SeekOptions options);\n};\n```\n\nThis would correspond to the `currentTime` setter and the `fastSeek()` in the spec which has not been implemented AFAIK. (I believe it could also be overloaded to support the rational-time [`preciseSeek()`](https://www.w3.org/Bugs/Public/show_bug.cgi?id=23493), if the need should arise.)\n\n@padenot @jernoble @eric-carlson\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
