    "updated_at": "2016-02-01T16:36:04Z",
    "body": "The Bugzilla bug for `preciseSeek()` and its blocking bugs have sat idle for a very long time. Is this something you see requests for in Safari? My hunch is that rational times are most important in professional media software like video editors, and that HTML media elements as a whole are still far away from solving those use cases, even with rational times.\n",
