    "body": "Ah, cool! In that case we shouldn't drop it from the spec without a plan. It would be simple to keep as a (promise-less) alias for `seek()`, but in that form it'd be hard to convince others to implement it. What's your preferred outcome? Do you have telemetry for measuring feature usage in the wild?\n",
