    "created_at": "2016-02-04T01:55:57Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-02-04T01:55:57Z",
    "body": "I've renamed the issue to decouple it somewhat from `fastSeek()`, the [comment](https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/505#issuecomment-171229898) that this spawned from was about seeking generally.\n\nWhat ought to be uncontroversial is introducing a `seek()` which behaves like the `currentTime` setter but returns a promise, and whether or not to merge `fastSeek()` into that is not a given.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
